# COMPONENT

## ViewSample

### PACKAGE

org.sample.view

### DESCRIPTION

Dedicated view/read-model sample component.

### SPECIFICATION

This component demonstrates a view-oriented read surface generated from `ENTITY > VIEW`.
It keeps the runtime small and uses the generated view service rather than a handwritten repository layer.

# ENTITY

## Person

### DESCRIPTION

Person record used as the source entity for the first view sample.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type     | multiplicity |
|-------+----------+--------------|
| id    | entityid | 1            |
| name  | name     | 1            |
| city  | string   | 1            |
| title | string   | 1            |

### VIEW

#### DESCRIPTION

Read-model view for loading and searching people as presentation-facing cards.

#### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type     | multiplicity |
|-------+----------+--------------|
| id    | entityid | 1            |
| name  | name     | 1            |
| city  | string   | 1            |
| title | string   | 1            |
